    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " spoke to Moses, after the death of the two sons of Aaron, when they drew near before the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " and died; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.6.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 6.19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.9.7"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "9.7",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.9.25"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "25",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " and the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " said to Moses, “Tell Aaron your brother not to come at all times into the holy place within the veil, before the mercy seat which is upon the ark, lest he die; for I will appear in the cloud upon the mercy seat. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "But thus shall Aaron come into the holy place: with a young bull for a sin offering and a ram for a burnt offering. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "He shall put on the holy linen coat, and shall have the linen breeches on his body, be girded with the linen girdle, and wear the linen turban; these are the holy garments. He shall bathe his body in water, and then put them on. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he shall take from the congregation of the people of Israel two male goats for a sin offering, and one ram for a burnt offering.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“And Aaron shall offer the bull as a sin offering for himself, and shall make atonement for himself and for his house. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he shall take the two goats, and set them before the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " at the door of the tent of meeting; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and Aaron shall cast lots upon the two goats, one lot for the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " and the other lot for Azazel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And Aaron shall present the goat on which the lot fell for the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", and offer it as a sin offering; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "but the goat on which the lot fell for Azazel shall be presented alive before the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " to make atonement over it, that it may be sent away into the wilderness to Azazel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aaron shall present the bull as a sin offering for himself, and shall make atonement for himself and for his house; he shall kill the bull as a sin offering for himself. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he shall take a censer full of coals of fire from the altar before the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", and two handfuls of sweet incense beaten small; and he shall bring it within the veil ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and put the incense on the fire before the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ", that the cloud of the incense may cover the mercy seat which is upon the testimony, lest he die; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and he shall take some of the blood of the bull, and sprinkle it with his finger on the front of the mercy seat, and before the mercy seat he shall sprinkle the blood with his finger seven times.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Then he shall kill the goat of the sin offering which is for the people, and bring its blood within the veil, and do with its blood as he did with the blood of the bull, sprinkling it upon the mercy seat and before the mercy seat; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "thus he shall make atonement for the holy place, because of the uncleannesses of the people of Israel, and because of their transgressions, all their sins; and so he shall do for the tent of meeting, which abides with them in the midst of their uncleannesses. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "There shall be no man in the tent of meeting when he enters to make atonement in the holy place until he comes out and has made atonement for himself and for his house and for all the assembly of Israel. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Then he shall go out to the altar which is before the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " and make atonement for it, and shall take some of the blood of the bull and of the blood of the goat, and put it on the horns of the altar round about. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he shall sprinkle some of the blood upon it with his finger seven times, and cleanse it and hallow it from the uncleannesses of the people of Israel.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“And when he has made an end of atoning for the holy place and the tent of meeting and the altar, he shall present the live goat; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and Aaron shall lay both his hands upon the head of the live goat, and confess over him all the iniquities of the people of Israel, and all their transgressions, all their sins; and he shall put them upon the head of the goat, and send him away into the wilderness by the hand of a man who is in readiness. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "The goat shall bear all their iniquities upon him to a solitary land; and he shall let the goat go in the wilderness.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Then Aaron shall come into the tent of meeting, and shall put off the linen garments which he put on when he went into the holy place, and shall leave them there; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "and he shall bathe his body in water in a holy place, and put on his garments, and come forth, and offer his burnt offering and the burnt offering of the people, and make atonement for himself and for the people. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the fat of the sin offering he shall burn upon the altar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he who lets the goat go to Azazel shall wash his clothes and bathe his body in water, and afterward he may come into the camp. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "HEB.13.11"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Heb 13.11",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " And the bull for the sin offering and the goat for the sin offering, whose blood was brought in to make atonement in the holy place, shall be carried forth outside the camp; their skin and their flesh and their dung shall be burned with fire. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And he who burns them shall wash his clothes and bathe his body in water, and afterward he may come into the camp.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“And it shall be a statute to you for ever that in the seventh month, on the tenth day of the month, you shall afflict yourselves, and shall do no work, either the native or the stranger who sojourns among you; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "for on this day shall atonement be made for you, to cleanse you; from all your sins you shall be clean before the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": ". ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "It is a sabbath of solemn rest to you, and you shall afflict yourselves; it is a statute for ever. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And the priest who is anointed and consecrated as priest in his father's place shall make atonement, wearing the holy linen garments; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "he shall make atonement for the sanctuary, and he shall make atonement for the tent of meeting and for the altar, and he shall make atonement for the priests and for all the people of the assembly. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 16:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "And this shall be an everlasting statute for you, that atonement may be made for the people of Israel once in the year because of all their sins.” And Moses did as the ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " commanded him.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.16.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.16.34"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
